        "original_id": "123d8917-47dc-5e59-9339-5ae1981fadfa",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jennifer Grey, Carroll Ballard, Matthew Modine, Cliff Robertson, Ian Paul Cassidy, Patrick Swayze, C. Thomas Howell, Lea Thompson, Charlie Sheen\n- Films: Wind, Red Dawn, For the Boys, In the Line of Fire\n- Roles: director, actress\n\nFacts:\n- Jennifer Grey was born on March 26, 1960, and she is an American actress.\n- In the first years of the 1990s, Ian Paul Cassidy appeared in U.S. films including For the Boys, Wind, and In the Line of Fire.\n- The film Wind was directed by Carroll Ballard and starred Matthew Modine, Jennifer Grey, and Cliff Robertson.\n- The film Red Dawn starred Patrick Swayze, C. Thomas Howell, Lea Thompson, Charlie Sheen, and Jennifer Grey.",
